Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Soo-hyun - Kim Ji-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Park Sung-hoon - Kwak Dong-yeon - Lee Joo-bin{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Gab-soo - Lee Mi-sook{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jung Jin-young - Na Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jeon Bae-soo - Hwang Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Jung-nan - Kim Joo-ryoung{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jang Yoon-ju - Kim Do-hyun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.13,0:00:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Screenwriter: Park Ji-eun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Directors: Jang Young-woo - Kim Hee-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queen of Tears{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.06,0:01:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Where's the money? We\Ndemand our land compensation!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.58,0:01:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.58,0:01:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they acting up\Nwhen we're the victims here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.17,0:01:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Land compensation?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.88,0:01:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All chaos will break loose if we go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.37,0:01:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.38,0:01:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Where can we go, if not home?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.18,0:01:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't go to a hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.23,0:01:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.52,0:01:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, the back gate is\Nempty. You can come this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.40,0:01:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.78,0:01:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn back. Take the back gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.04,0:02:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So? Are they coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.12,0:02:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.33,0:02:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,"A conglomerate family becomes\Ndirt-poor and is kicked out."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.79,0:02:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.22,0:02:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, you need to step out for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.86,0:02:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you aware that Chairman Hong\Ngave Ms. Moh the power of attorney...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.24,0:02:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,to manage everything in Queens Town...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.20,0:02:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,during his absence?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.41,0:02:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.62,0:02:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she kicking us out?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.29,0:02:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.58,0:02:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Given how this place is swarming...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.00,0:02:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,with reporters and protesters,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.79,0:02:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,she wants you to lie low until the dust settles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.13,0:03:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Does she have the right to do\Nthat? We're all residents here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.85,0:03:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get involved when the adults are talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.43,0:03:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.68,0:03:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.02,0:03:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.45,0:03:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.53,0:03:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Company vehicles, drivers,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.12,0:03:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,phones, and credit cards are no longer yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.79,0:03:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Your company security cards\Nand key cards won't work, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? It's my home!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.96,0:03:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Call the police, Honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.92,0:03:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, call them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.46,0:03:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The reporters would love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.17,0:03:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Given our history together,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I've packed up some essentials for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.64,0:03:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,so get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.65,0:03:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's that?\N- Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.23,0:04:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in! There are cameras on the other side!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.79,0:04:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Isn't this absurd, Hyun-woo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.27,0:04:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}How can Seul-hee...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.33,0:04:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}lock the doors and kick us out...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.41,0:04:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}of our father's home?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.71,0:04:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You can assert your rights\Nas residents of the home,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.38,0:04:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}but you must file a lawsuit,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.00,0:04:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and it'll take some time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.30,0:04:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}but the biggest issue is,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.68,0:04:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}the chairman included a convertible\Nrights clause in the contract,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.57,0:04:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and put his family as joint surety,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.14,0:04:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}so your real estate, stocks,\Nand personal bank accounts...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}are all frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.27,0:04:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Gosh, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.27,0:04:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hold on. Is this true, Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.07,0:04:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I didn't know either. I'm flustered too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Lip balm, anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.24,0:04:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Lip balm, my foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.24,0:04:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's best that the media\Ndoesn't post photos of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you somewhere safe, and\Nwe can think of our next plan there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.17,0:04:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why has Soo-cheol been so quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.96,0:05:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Soo-cheol! Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.75,0:05:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So your wife, Da-hye, was\Nin on this too. Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I say? Geon-u\Ndoesn't take after him at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.47,0:05:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.78,0:05:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.50,0:05:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is that?\N- What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.01,0:05:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who's blinding us?\N- Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.68,0:05:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wait.\N- Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.55,0:05:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This is private property.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.31,0:05:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- Is that Hyun-woo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.56,0:05:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.67,0:05:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.73,0:06:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hyun-woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.44,0:06:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.61,0:06:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, it was urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.49,0:06:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hyun-woo. Why weren't you picking up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.53,0:06:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you eat well?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.45,0:06:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You look terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, it's...\N- Don't be so distraught.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.24,0:06:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you left that crazy family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at what happened to\Nthem after they kicked you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.17,0:06:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Karma will always find its way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.75,0:06:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hold on...\N- You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.21,0:06:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so relieved to hear...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.80,0:06:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,that the family was ruined. Serves them right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.22,0:06:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, forget about that\Nsly fox and live a happy life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.56,0:06:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The sly fox is here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.19,0:06:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.36,0:06:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.95,0:06:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not just her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.02,0:07:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.73,0:07:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your father-in-law. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.86,0:07:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it "former father-in-law"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.28,0:07:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway... What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.87,0:07:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.79,0:07:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.45,0:07:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.16,0:07:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.46,0:07:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hello.\N- Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.67,0:07:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize for coming unannounced.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.75,0:07:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.01,0:07:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.93,0:07:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please follow me. This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.80,0:07:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm returning to Seoul.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.93,0:07:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hail a cab.\N- Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.31,0:08:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no cabs around here at this hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll find another way, so do as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.69,0:08:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We're already here, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.70,0:08:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you I didn't want to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.36,0:08:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.17,0:08:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.96,0:08:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I think she stepped on cow dung.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.85,0:08:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, don't come. Don't come to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come to me either!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.86,0:08:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Kim?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.22,0:09:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.23,0:09:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hyeon-tae.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.27,0:09:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I picked plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.82,0:09:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to make sense of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.05,0:09:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.07,0:09:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did Hyun-woo bring his ex-wife\Nand her family all the way here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.83,0:09:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's similar to Korea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.83,0:09:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be North and South,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.54,0:09:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but we're still on the\Nsame team at the Olympics.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.13,0:09:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We join hands when there's a common enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this mean they might get back together?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.80,0:10:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We may be on the same team, but\Nthat doesn't guarantee a unification.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.64,0:10:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's get ready.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.45,0:10:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.53,0:10:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.62,0:10:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll look for a new place to go tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.56,0:10:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing will change...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.95,0:10:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.33,0:10:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. All the more reason\Nwe shouldn't stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.88,0:10:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take some time until the dust settles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the safest and the most\Ncomfortable place you can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.30,0:10:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm at my former in-laws' home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.98,0:10:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Not you. Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.23,0:10:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This is comfortable for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.57,0:10:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.61,0:10:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,be selfish for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.15,0:11:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I have too much on my plate right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.49,0:11:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,to worry about you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.12,0:11:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.33,0:11:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We're divorced.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.37,0:11:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,or my family...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.83,0:11:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,has nothing to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.97,0:11:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stop worrying...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.43,0:11:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,once you're better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.90,0:11:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.86,0:11:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,that's impossible,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.53,0:11:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,so please...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.32,0:11:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.20,0:11:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.41,0:11:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.05,0:12:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think being together...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,in this situation will make us happier?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.68,0:12:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be less miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.01,0:12:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think too much for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.01,0:12:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just focus on being less miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.99,0:12:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I got rid of the chunks. As for the smell...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.50,0:12:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take some time to dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.71,0:12:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Just throw them away.\N- Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What for? They look expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.59,0:12:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wear these for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.08,0:13:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What about these heels?\NShould I throw them away?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.63,0:13:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Will she get rid of them, or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.30,0:13:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They look expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.42,0:13:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Over $500.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.65,0:13:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,$5000?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.79,0:13:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't come here by choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.17,0:14:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Your son was very quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.21,0:14:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He practically kidnapped us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.42,0:14:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My late mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.55,0:14:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.55,0:14:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She said, "You never know\Nwhat the future holds."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew we'd meet again a few\Ndays after we bid our last farewell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.23,0:14:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My sister is urging us to stay\Nat her villa in Namhae instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.86,0:14:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll leave first thing in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.15,0:14:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.32,0:14:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but don't be so confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.93,0:14:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.47,0:14:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Please eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.72,0:14:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.42,0:15:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.26,0:15:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it suit your taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.34,0:15:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's very delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.89,0:15:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.60,0:15:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to cut down on sodium.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.89,0:15:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor Yoon will scold you\Nif he finds out. Don't eat that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.23,0:15:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. He hasn't been answering my calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he blocked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.95,0:16:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you eating, Soo-cheol?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.13,0:16:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.84,0:16:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have water?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.13,0:16:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.93,0:16:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.55,0:16:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.52,0:16:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I only drink sealed water.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.43,0:16:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have bottled water?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.77,0:16:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, just drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.02,0:16:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we have some at the store. I'll bring some.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.40,0:16:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. I'd prefer mineral\Nwater from the Alps, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry? The Alps?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.66,0:16:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.50,0:16:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.71,0:16:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still immature.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.38,0:16:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.34,0:16:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.55,0:16:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't have to be from the Alps.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.05,0:16:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Germany or Australia is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.10,0:17:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiji is okay too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.60,0:17:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not that picky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.56,0:17:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm fine with them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.82,0:17:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just drink from the kettle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.33,0:17:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.41,0:17:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- Gosh.\N- No, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.58,0:17:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,She doesn't hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.21,0:17:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see her hit her brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.09,0:17:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I was terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.47,0:17:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? You hit me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.51,0:17:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, my slaps aren't that painful,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.60,0:17:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but Hae-in was totally...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.18,0:17:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.60,0:17:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.15,0:17:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.19,0:17:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you don't need to help. You can just rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.65,0:17:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.12,0:18:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Hae-in...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.16,0:18:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.45,0:18:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,May I say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.20,0:18:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you two are divorced...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.92,0:18:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.08,0:18:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take to heart what I said earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.80,0:18:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Which was?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.30,0:18:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,About your being a sly fox and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.59,0:18:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Right.\N- I never disliked sly foxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.72,0:18:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, that was my nickname in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I look like a fox, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.89,0:18:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to apologize for\Nsaying your family was ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.60,0:18:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.56,0:18:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.40,0:18:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a touchy subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.07,0:18:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're divorced,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.90,0:18:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but did you agree to come here...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.49,0:18:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,because you had feelings for each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.49,0:18:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.74,0:18:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It was an emergency. Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.45,0:18:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. You're strangers now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.78,0:18:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.16,0:18:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But could there be something between you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.25,0:18:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.87,0:18:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.13,0:18:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't have divorced if that was the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.04,0:18:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.59,0:18:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.17,0:18:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So please don't misunderstand, anticipate,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.34,0:19:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,or give meaning to any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.64,0:19:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't. Remember So-yeong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.68,0:19:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The principal's daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.79,0:19:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She recently got a job\Nat a middle school nearby,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and has been asking for Hyun-woo's number,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.27,0:19:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- but I couldn't tell her.\N- You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.11,0:19:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.90,0:19:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But then again, I didn't\Nneed to ask for permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.62,0:19:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.37,0:19:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.37,0:19:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't get back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.04,0:19:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I don't want that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.21,0:19:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.54,0:19:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,She didn't bother to hear\Nme out and kept cutting me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.76,0:19:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, that sly fox. She shouldn't have come.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.72,0:19:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our annex.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.22,0:19:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We used to live here before\NHyeon-tae and Mi-seon...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.48,0:19:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,got married.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.02,0:19:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We heated up the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.44,0:19:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.38,0:20:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.40,0:20:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.99,0:20:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Even neighbors help out...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.07,0:20:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,when times are rough,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.53,0:20:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,but we...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.58,0:20:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,used to be family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.62,0:20:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo told me it's a secret that you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.04,0:20:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I already warned the villagers...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.96,0:20:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,not to use the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.46,0:20:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no CCTV cameras around,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.84,0:20:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and barely anyone uses a smartphone here,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.51,0:20:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,so don't worry, and have a good night's sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.52,0:20:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.52,0:20:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.11,0:20:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You can wash up in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.49,0:20:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the tub?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.49,0:20:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't one,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.53,0:20:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but here's the shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Where can I take a bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.58,0:20:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.58,0:21:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- What about my bath bomb?\N- Don't use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.30,0:21:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You can use this towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.37,0:21:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Baek Ho-yeol's First Birthday{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.72,0:21:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say your nephew's name was Ho-yeol?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.85,0:21:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Baek Ho-yeol.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.48,0:21:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This "baby Ho-yeol" can't possibly be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.02,0:21:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,the boy I saw earlier, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.40,0:21:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.20,0:21:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. He used to be so tiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.87,0:21:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He was so adorable. Yes, this is him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.83,0:21:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's the same person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.83,0:21:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how old is this towel?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.04,0:21:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.84,0:21:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Do you want a new one?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.17,0:21:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.13,0:21:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.43,0:21:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,what's even more unbelievable\Nthan this eight-year-old towel?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.39,0:21:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.15,0:22:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Da-hye and Geon-u have left me,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.11,0:22:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and Yoon Eun-sung, that jerk deceived me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.87,0:22:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.04,0:22:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.25,0:22:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.00,0:22:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Hae-in's family?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.05,0:22:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.05,0:22:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.09,0:22:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.51,0:22:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you want them to stay, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.80,0:22:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we possibly live...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.35,0:22:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,under the same roof as those we stole from?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.85,0:22:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.27,0:22:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll try to find your weakness,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.81,0:22:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and retaliate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.61,0:22:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You should've just kept them close...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.24,0:22:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.65,0:22:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,just want to keep Hae-in close?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.32,0:22:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.45,0:22:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You will, eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.03,0:22:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother regretting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.58,0:22:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lived here for 25 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.58,0:23:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,but this is the first time I get to pick...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.83,0:23:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,my own wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.59,0:23:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start enjoying what we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.67,0:23:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.09,0:23:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember what you said when you sent me away?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.18,0:23:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Don't forget.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.01,0:23:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I love you the most,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.81,0:23:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}so I'll stay strong and endure it,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.35,0:23:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}even when I miss you...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.61,0:23:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}and want to see you,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.11,0:23:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}just because I love you.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.78,0:23:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And you kept your word.\NYou were pretty good at it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.45,0:23:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You were never curious about how\Nyour young son was doing abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.62,0:23:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You never bothered to call.\NYou really endured it all,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.29,0:23:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but you see,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.17,0:23:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I realized it was a lie...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.42,0:23:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,to endure something out of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.05,0:23:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't endure it...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.51,0:23:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,if you truly love someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.06,0:24:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you getting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.23,0:24:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.81,0:24:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,you resent me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.97,0:24:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.98,0:24:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you I'll bring\NHae-in back here at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.03,0:24:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.61,0:24:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It drives me crazy to wonder\Nwhere she is, and what she's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.16,0:24:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.83,0:24:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,endure it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.92,0:24:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you even know how difficult\Nit was to come this far?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.75,0:24:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you think I'm doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.09,0:24:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't share the same goal,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.22,0:24:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,so just like how you chose this family over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.02,0:24:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can also choose...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.27,0:24:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,something else over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.20,0:25:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Check all the hotels and villas.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.92,0:25:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a living hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.13,0:25:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of hell offers us a silk blanket...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.38,0:25:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and a warm floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.82,0:25:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.74,0:25:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be utterly distraught.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.03,0:25:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's never slept on hard floors before.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.70,0:25:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He can only sleep on Spanish royal beds.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.25,0:25:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ours looks thicker than his.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.05,0:25:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's switch blankets.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.05,0:25:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.01,0:25:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.09,0:26:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.60,0:26:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my first time sleeping on the floor, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.81,0:26:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm from a rich family too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.57,0:26:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hello?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.45,0:26:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Beom-seok.\N- {\i1}I saw the news.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.95,0:26:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How is everyone?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.87,0:26:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A total mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.21,0:26:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel terrible for Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.42,0:26:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm hanging up if this is about him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.42,0:26:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.30,0:26:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Remember what he said?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.68,0:26:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He told me not to even come to his funeral,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.97,0:26:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so don't call me, even if he passes away.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.56,0:26:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Don't be like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.02,0:26:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I resented him when he was healthy,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.36,0:26:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but now that he's sick,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.23,0:26:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel so guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.24,0:26:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For what?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.07,0:27:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe everything would've been okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.45,0:27:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,if I'd treated Seul-hee better.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.21,0:27:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she was livid because I mistreated her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.34,0:27:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,About ten years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.71,0:27:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I threw a huge fit when Father told me...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.84,0:27:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,he wanted her to be his legal wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.42,0:27:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,so he gave up on that idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.63,0:27:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she held a grudge and schemed everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.68,0:27:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This stupid ring. It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.39,0:27:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I should've just let her have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.27,0:27:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I give it back to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.94,0:27:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I give it to her right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.16,0:27:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Beom-ja.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.87,0:27:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like I'm to blame\Nfor what happened to Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.55,0:28:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying? Did your husband leave you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.43,0:28:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- No.\N- Then are your parents sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.44,0:28:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.86,0:28:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My father is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.15,0:28:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.65,0:28:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's normal to feel guilty...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.57,0:28:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,when your parent gets sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.41,0:28:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.41,0:28:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it all out and start treating him better.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.25,0:28:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.00,0:28:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.84,0:28:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.63,0:28:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.80,0:28:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.14,0:28:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.01,0:28:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There's this lunatic who calls\Nme "Mom" and follows me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.42,0:28:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.48,0:28:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you tell him you're my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.40,0:29:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.44,0:29:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.86,0:29:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late to be out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.45,0:29:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. This is my mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.00,0:29:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- so go on your way.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.00,0:29:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm her daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.29,0:29:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,so leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.96,0:29:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you from Seoul?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.51,0:29:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,She's my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.26,0:29:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, she's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.43,0:29:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, aren't you going to watch the drama?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.22,0:29:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The drama?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.69,0:29:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't skip out on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.81,0:29:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.74,0:29:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The soap opera.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.66,0:29:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.99,0:29:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.38,0:30:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Must've Been Love{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.80,0:30:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo and I have similar tastes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.73,0:30:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Are you sleeping?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.79,0:30:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}I'm about to.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.42,0:30:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Why?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.84,0:30:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}I need to go to work early tomorrow,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.46,0:30:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}so I won't be able to see you...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.93,0:30:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Going to work early tomorrow.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.14,0:30:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}When will you be coming home...?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.06,0:31:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Okay.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.28,0:31:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Should I take tomorrow off?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.28,0:31:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Can you just take tomorrow off?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.93,0:31:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Good night.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.18,0:31:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}I'm going to listen to the songs\Non your MP3 before I sleep.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.24,0:31:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}That? How are the songs?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.19,0:31:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}They're all oldies.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.82,0:31:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}I like them.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.32,0:31:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}They're all my favorite songs.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.45,0:31:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}That MP3 isn't mine.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.07,0:31:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}- Then?\N- I picked it up in the past.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.99,0:31:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}I couldn't find the owner,\Nso I kept it with me all along.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.79,0:31:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Where did you find it?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.95,0:32:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}At my high school.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.04,0:32:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}On the field.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.33,0:32:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Didn't you go to Hanil Foreign\NLanguage High School?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.29,0:32:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Yes, I picked it up on my first day there.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.07,0:32:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.86,0:32:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So this was mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.99,0:32:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Wait.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.85,0:33:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.23,0:33:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.98,0:33:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.48,0:33:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.78,0:33:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Was he born...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.57,0:33:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,to love me or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.91,0:33:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He fell for me in that brief moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.12,0:33:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,so he kept this all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.79,0:33:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd be so shocked if he\Nfinds out the girl he fell for...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.62,0:33:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.80,0:33:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}But why do you still have it?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.55,0:33:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}She must've been so pretty.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.14,0:33:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.64,0:33:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.02,0:33:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.57,0:33:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.40,0:33:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.82,0:33:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.91,0:34:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That was years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.53,0:34:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.04,0:34:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that you still kept\Nthis all these years must mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.96,0:34:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,you couldn't get her out of your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.84,0:34:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She must've been gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.05,0:34:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.97,0:34:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.14,0:34:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,if the person was male,\Nfemale, a teacher, a student,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.93,0:34:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,or a security guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.64,0:34:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't remember a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.94,0:34:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why still keep it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.99,0:34:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not keeping it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.49,0:34:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I just stashed it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.83,0:34:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. You can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.54,0:34:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Go. Go sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.55,0:34:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.84,0:35:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The curtain.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.47,0:35:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you draw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.35,0:35:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This room is facing east,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.72,0:35:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,so it gets pretty bright in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.77,0:35:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.28,0:38:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.62,0:38:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.83,0:38:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make some {\i1}japchae.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.66,0:38:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you chop these carrots for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.88,0:38:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.38,0:38:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweetie, be careful not to chop your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.64,0:38:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to julienne it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.68,0:38:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly how thin do you want me to chop them?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.81,0:38:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.06,0:38:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.12,0:39:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mother.\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.88,0:39:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.42,0:39:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so incredible about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.51,0:39:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you say that? This is like...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.76,0:39:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,modern art.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.22,0:39:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.22,0:39:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.64,0:39:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.44,0:39:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making {\i1}japchae,{\i0} right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.40,0:39:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What else do you need to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.90,0:39:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Next...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.74,0:39:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to cook some eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.65,0:39:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- How exactly do you do that?\N- The eggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.82,0:39:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a cakewalk. Should I show you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.99,0:39:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.79,0:39:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.17,0:39:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can use both hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.97,0:39:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.39,0:39:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're truly amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.01,0:39:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I? Should I give it a spin too?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.43,0:39:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A spin?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.06,0:40:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.81,0:40:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the change of heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.06,0:40:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You said your villa was vacant.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.82,0:40:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Is your husband against it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.90,0:40:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In case the reporters find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.03,0:40:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.83,0:40:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who helped him whenever\Nhis business was failing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.62,0:40:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he do this to\Nmy husband, of all people?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.75,0:40:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.75,0:40:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.84,0:40:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.71,0:40:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I was looking everywhere for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.93,0:40:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.47,0:40:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They're clean now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.39,0:40:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't smell at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.31,0:40:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.47,0:40:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- Have them if you want.\N- Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.94,0:40:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're extremely expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.27,0:40:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. They're yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.07,0:40:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you let me do your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.49,0:40:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm very skilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.62,0:41:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of hairstyle do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.62,0:41:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What can you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.54,0:41:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.05,0:41:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to work in Cheongdam-dong, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.80,0:41:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mi-seon, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.60,0:41:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the best twist ever\Nsince "The Sixth Sense."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.72,0:41:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Even my palms are sweaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.81,0:41:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey...\N- You bad-mouthed that sly fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.53,0:41:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I heard she suddenly appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.94,0:41:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That only happens in movies or dramas.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.77,0:41:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is more thrilling than any drama ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.86,0:41:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes.\N- So what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.65,0:41:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, let's talk later.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.99,0:41:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard Hae-in's mother is a psychopath.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.78,0:41:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? That's just nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.45,0:41:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- Go!\N- Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.08,0:41:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving. My husband told me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.25,0:41:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard she stepped on\Ndung the moment she arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.00,0:41:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and cried a river.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.80,0:42:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's crazy. How could she step\Non dung as soon as she arrived?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.14,0:42:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's be frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.35,0:42:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Your mom is the one who stepped in dung.\N- That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.48,0:42:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They're former in-laws who\Nended things on a bad note.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.27,0:42:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That dirt-poor family fled\Nin the middle of the night,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.02,0:42:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and Ms. Jeon had to take them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.53,0:42:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I saw the news. They\Nhave nothing to their names now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.07,0:42:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mom may look tough,\Nbut she's such a softie at heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.91,0:42:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes.\N- Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.04,0:42:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, isn't that woman so shameless?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.83,0:42:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare she come here after what she's done?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.50,0:42:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- Right.\N- You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.34,0:42:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to see her face just once.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.92,0:42:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.01,0:42:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Is there something on my lips?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.81,0:42:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then look.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.35,0:42:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted to see me, so take a good look.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.61,0:42:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Our assets are just frozen for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.61,0:42:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not dirt-poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.99,0:43:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it was late when we arrived,\Nwe didn't flee in the middle of the night,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.40,0:43:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and we'll be leaving soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.49,0:43:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not mooching off of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.04,0:43:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.62,0:43:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes.\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.88,0:43:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.21,0:43:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you take me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.84,0:43:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.43,0:43:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.39,0:43:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.10,0:43:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking these to the orchard.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.22,0:43:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The cold-bean-soup noodles\Nare tasty and refreshing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.64,0:43:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like some?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.07,0:43:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have carbs during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.45,0:43:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh. Then when will you have them?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.30,0:44:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you feel about\Nbecoming the youngest chairman?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.35,0:44:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.14,0:44:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it any different from\Nthe previous management?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.29,0:44:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's rumor of a large-scale\Nrestructuring. Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.23,0:44:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How is Chairman Hong doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.65,0:44:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I plan to establish a\Ncorporation in Singapore by 2025,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.61,0:44:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,so we can branch out to foreign markets.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.33,0:44:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll cost us about $140 million to establish...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.70,0:44:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and run this corporation\Nthat'll serve as the foundation...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.29,0:44:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,for department stores and supermarkets abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.54,0:44:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I visited Mr. Song at the\Npenitentiary and spoke with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.46,0:44:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he knows where\Nthe chairman's secret fund is.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.26,0:44:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He created the fund and transferred it abroad,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.47,0:44:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but he doesn't know where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.68,0:44:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.72,0:44:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The chairman's office\Nmanually managed the ledger,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.02,0:44:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and handed it to the chairman to be reviewed.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.06,0:44:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The laundering process was complicated,\Nsince they went through ten countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.73,0:45:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The last destination was\Na bank in Labuan, Malaysia,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.73,0:45:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,but the money wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.83,0:45:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted to see me, Chairman Yoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.33,0:45:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't hesitate...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.46,0:45:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,to call me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.09,0:45:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.42,0:45:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Things have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.63,0:45:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no longer a part of\NQueens or Hae-in's husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.55,0:45:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I see,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.60,0:45:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.60,0:45:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel uncomfortable that you're\Nstill leading our legal team.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.73,0:45:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.94,0:45:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Baek.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.57,0:45:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop the act, already.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.45,0:45:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be honest, since you\Nseem to know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.62,0:45:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.83,0:45:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I submitted my résumé to\NBaekhwa, Taepung, Hwang & Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.88,0:46:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're still negotiating my salary,\Nbut it's not easy in this field.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.92,0:46:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to raise your salary\Nif you've been on a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.76,0:46:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,As you already know,\NI didn't receive any alimony,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.14,0:46:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,so I need to make this work.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.76,0:46:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I only need one month.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.43,0:46:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you please help me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.69,0:46:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're looking for a new job?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.73,0:46:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct, and as you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.11,0:46:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no access to the legal\Nteam's classified documents.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.53,0:46:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.12,0:46:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You may go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.75,0:46:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.04,0:46:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.29,0:46:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't it you who picked her up yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.63,0:46:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.85,0:46:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.68,0:46:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know either.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.85,0:47:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You picked her up, but you\Ndon't know where she went?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.48,0:47:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.61,0:47:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess she couldn't trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.27,0:47:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,She took the car and hasn't been picking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.11,0:47:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me know...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.78,0:47:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,if you find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.11,0:47:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.86,0:47:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the true owner of this teacup.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.53,0:47:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It suits you much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.24,0:47:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I love your outfit too.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.74,0:47:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You look glamorous and elegant. That's rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.74,0:48:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is why I haven't been dressing up.\NIt's easy for me to look glamorous.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.75,0:48:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come by the spa before I close it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.50,0:48:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me take care of you one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.63,0:48:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you closing it down?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.55,0:48:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.55,0:48:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? Hasn't business been good?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.23,0:48:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you should shut it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.10,0:48:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.10,0:48:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You've had it for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.56,0:48:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.82,0:48:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd grow old while\Nmaking others look more youthful.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.24,0:48:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- That can't happen.\N- Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.07,0:48:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I take office, I want\Nto launch a cosmetic line...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.08,0:48:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,with products from the department store.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.04,0:48:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.12,0:48:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like Lafayette or Harrods,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.29,0:48:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,we should give our store\Na luxurious reputation...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.79,0:48:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.92,0:48:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"Take office"?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.26,0:48:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.43,0:48:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't I taking over Hae-in's spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.72,0:48:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Would it look too weird\Nif I took over right away?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.64,0:49:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about a director first?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.40,0:49:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.57,0:49:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Close down your spa,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.41,0:49:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,pack up your stuff, and\Njoin Director Jo in the U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.78,0:49:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We have too much to lose if they catch you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.58,0:49:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You can start a small\Ncosmetic line there if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.21,0:49:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll look for some investors.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.29,0:49:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You can shut down your business,\Nmove, and go into hiding,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.04,0:49:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but one thing you can't\Nchange is your child's academy...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.54,0:49:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}if you're a parent.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.60,0:49:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His daughter is a senior.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.02,0:49:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's preparing to go to\Ncollege by majoring in cello.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.94,0:49:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I sued you for fraud and violating\Nthe Communications Privacy Act,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.73,0:49:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but they couldn't send you\Nthe papers since you were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.28,0:49:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I looked everywhere for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.38,0:50:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So he had this all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.54,0:50:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He must've made a copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.26,0:50:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.84,0:50:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Soo-cheol, let me reveal the truth...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.60,0:50:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}about your former wife, Cheon Da-hye.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.56,0:50:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}It might scare you a bit.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.52,0:50:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}You said you'd get rashes just\Neating next to an older woman,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.11,0:50:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}but you see, I'm five years your senior.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.36,0:50:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Everything about my parents,\Ntheir wealth, and my education is fake.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.70,0:50:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}One more. Geon-u isn't your son.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.79,0:50:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}How wasn't it obvious?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.37,0:50:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}You have sharp features,\Nwhile Geon-u's are soft.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.37,0:50:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}How couldn't you suspect it?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.75,0:50:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}I'm sad to leave you too.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.92,0:50:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}I'll never meet another man like you.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.22,0:51:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Are you going to marry me, or not?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.34,0:51:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I said no.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.72,0:51:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Fine, but give me your gloves then.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.86,0:51:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}You're skittish yet clumsy.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.06,0:51:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}What's my name again?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.39,0:51:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Cheon Da-hye.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.77,0:51:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}You're rich, but you're not too bright.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.73,0:51:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Can you promise that I don't have to marry you?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.28,0:51:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Yes.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.36,0:51:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}By the way, is that muffler warm?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.32,0:51:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}You should've recognized me\Nafter giving me everything I wanted.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.14,0:51:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Please give them a round of applause...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.14,0:51:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}as they begin their new journey.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.06,0:51:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}They're both good-looking.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.27,0:51:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hey.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.40,0:51:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Don't make me frustrated.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.40,0:51:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I was so annoyed when\NHae-in refused to listen to me,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.28,0:52:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}and chose that guy instead.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.99,0:52:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}You'd better seduce Soo-cheol\Nand marry him right away.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.57,0:52:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}All right.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.99,0:52:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Don't tell him your real name.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.62,0:52:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Use a fake one.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.91,0:52:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}No, I'm going to use my real name.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.33,0:52:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}By the way, where is he?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.00,0:52:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Over there.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.38,0:52:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Don't ever get married.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.84,0:52:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}It's so hectic.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.05,0:52:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- No way.\N- I know.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.09,0:52:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}That's the crybaby I knew?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.47,0:52:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}He's so tall... Just my type.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.43,0:52:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}No, behind him.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.69,0:52:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}That fool. He hasn't changed.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.69,0:52:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Gosh.\N- Anyway, eat up, since you're here anyway.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.49,0:52:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Goodbye.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.55,0:53:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Sir.\N- It's nice to see you.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.01,0:53:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Where have you been? I was looking for you.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.09,0:53:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I'm glad you're here.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.43,0:53:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Eat up.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.72,0:53:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}But you failed to recognize me.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.15,0:53:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hello.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.49,0:53:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}My name is Cheon Da-hye.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.87,0:53:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}"Cheon Da-hye"?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.91,0:53:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}That's a pretty name,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.08,0:53:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}and so is your face.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.50,0:53:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I see.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.63,0:53:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}You haven't eaten yet.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.67,0:53:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Let's see...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.13,0:53:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Forget me,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.97,0:53:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}like you have in the past.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.85,0:53:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Geon-u too.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.22,0:53:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}It won't be hard. You're\Nnot that bright, anyway.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.82,0:54:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.12,0:54:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.04,0:54:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Where will I find Da-hye?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.63,0:54:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.96,0:54:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,She took everything and\Nprobably went into hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.22,0:54:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're wrong. She forgot something.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.34,0:54:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.18,0:54:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.68,0:54:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.94,0:54:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She used to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.40,0:54:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the most precious person,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.73,0:54:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,so where did she go after leaving me behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.23,0:55:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, are you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.03,0:55:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.32,0:55:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.17,0:55:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this, Geon-u.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.63,0:55:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It used to be my favorite doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.64,0:55:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But what's the point of doing this now?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.35,0:55:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The tables have been turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.06,0:55:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'll turn them back again.\N- But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.98,0:56:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Eun-sung didn't achieve what he\Ndid legally, and I'll prove that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.19,0:56:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.35,0:56:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's say it was illegal\Nand we had all the proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.78,0:56:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Filing a suit, attending trials,\Nsuing him again for the stocks...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.67,0:56:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take at least five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.49,0:56:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you sure?\N- I'll take a shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.17,0:56:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Which is?\N- Investment fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.93,0:56:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He schemed a $2 billion investment fraud...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.83,0:56:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,from the start, and lured the family...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.70,0:56:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,with a new business idea to steal their stocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.08,0:56:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll get their provisional\Nseizures back if I can prove it,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.38,0:56:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,but most importantly, he'll lose his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.76,0:56:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the stocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.80,0:56:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The stocks would still be his.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.22,0:56:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to use the same tactic he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.19,0:56:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- What are you doing?\N- I just have a lot of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.85,0:56:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They should give us new\Npositions. I feel uneasy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.69,0:56:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.23,0:56:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never rejected Mr. Hong's call before.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.40,0:56:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.45,0:56:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's best to cut ties immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.20,0:56:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you pretty close with Ms. Hong, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.64,0:56:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.70,0:57:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Gosh.\N- Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.33,0:57:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know why "friendship"\Nand "loyalty" are abstract nouns?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.67,0:57:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Because they don't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.21,0:57:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Secretary Na and Ms. Hong don't\Nseem to be in touch at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.30,0:57:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,She's taking some time off.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.80,0:57:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,She's going to stay at a farm with her kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.93,0:57:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- And Mr. Baek?\N- He has no work these days,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.14,0:57:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,so he's been writing résumés...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.43,0:57:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and attending job interviews too.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.06,0:57:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear it!\NBring out the executives!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.90,0:57:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- Arrest them!\N- Arrest them!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.03,0:57:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We demand that Queens\Nresolve this investment fraud!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.82,0:57:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.70,0:57:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They look livid.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.70,0:57:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The legal director is also on their side!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.49,0:57:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You married into that family!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.95,0:57:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.00,0:57:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been fired from work and home.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.08,0:57:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He has no influence whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.38,0:57:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.55,0:57:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here to hear you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.76,0:57:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already told our story.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.51,0:57:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Queens lured us in by offering\Nto pay five times the market price.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.60,0:58:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they said the resort\Ncomplex project fell through,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.01,0:58:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and offered only double?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.23,0:58:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I think there was a double contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.65,0:58:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let me see the contract, and...\N- Don't be absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.79,0:58:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Attorney Hwang{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.38,0:58:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Bank President Gu Bon-jun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.23,0:58:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Assemblyman Han{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.35,0:58:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Director Ryu{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.65,0:58:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}I'm in a meeting. I'll call you back.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.70,0:59:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.20,0:59:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.04,0:59:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You work on the weekends too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.41,0:59:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.50,0:59:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The weeds never stop growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.17,0:59:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing more we can ask for...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.46,0:59:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,than some cold {\i1}makgeolli{\i0} and  {\i1}pajeon...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.76,0:59:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,after our morning work.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.58,0:59:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.59,0:59:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're living a great life surrounded by nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.56,0:59:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm envious.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.52,0:59:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.69,0:59:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,People will laugh if they\Nhear that a rich family...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.77,0:59:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,is envious of some farmers.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.82,0:59:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I'm not sure if\Nyou've had {\i1}makgeolli{\i0} before.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.07,0:59:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I did once,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.99,0:59:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,out of curiosity, back in college 30 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.08,0:59:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you should have some today.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.63,0:59:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.71,0:59:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- Here.\N- Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.17,0:59:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.63,1:00:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.59,1:00:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.97,1:00:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to make a toast, but what should we say?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.98,1:00:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,How about "Health matters the most"?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.52,1:00:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't say that,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.15,1:00:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,since his father is bedridden.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.03,1:00:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.07,1:00:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,"It's wonderful to see you"?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.99,1:00:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't work either,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.78,1:00:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,since their current situation...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.62,1:00:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,isn't that wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.00,1:00:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.96,1:00:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,clink our glasses.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.96,1:00:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.90,1:00:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.52,1:00:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.98,1:01:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.24,1:01:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.36,1:01:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's drink a bit more.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.45,1:01:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly. We should go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.12,1:01:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I won't go back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.62,1:01:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh. Is our home uncomfortable?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.54,1:01:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I do admit it's shabbier than...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.54,1:01:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not why!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.55,1:01:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,As the head of my family,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.97,1:01:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I should comfort them and say...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.89,1:01:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.27,1:01:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That things will pan out,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.64,1:01:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and we should go back home tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.27,1:01:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't say that right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.23,1:01:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too ashamed to face them.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.28,1:01:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to go home either.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.65,1:01:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.28,1:01:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Earlier today,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.41,1:01:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I called my closest friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.12,1:01:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd never asked for such a favor before,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.58,1:02:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,but I asked him for just\N$20,000, since we had no money.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.17,1:02:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.59,1:02:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He said no.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.76,1:02:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He was hesitant to give me money,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.97,1:02:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,since we'd be interrogated\Nby the prosecution soon,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.30,1:02:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and reporters are looking for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.18,1:02:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.47,1:02:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I was dumbfounded.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.18,1:02:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can understand why you were dumbfounded,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.19,1:02:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,since he was your closest friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.23,1:02:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not because of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.15,1:02:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,By the fact that I didn't even have $20,000.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.49,1:02:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd recently signed a tax\Ninvoice worth $45.6 million,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.03,1:02:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but now I don't even have $20,000 in my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.66,1:02:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel utterly pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.09,1:02:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.92,1:02:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if this will comfort you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.41,1:02:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.47,1:02:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But no one does.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.18,1:02:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No one has that much in their pockets.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.89,1:02:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Baek! I know you're lying\Njust to make me feel better!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.48,1:03:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean it!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.61,1:03:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never had that much before!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.61,1:03:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.66,1:03:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll talk again later.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.45,1:03:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Aunt Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.66,1:03:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.79,1:03:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you're in a pickle right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.34,1:03:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.96,1:03:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.96,1:03:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard it's a secret that you're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.30,1:03:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. No one will\Nhear a peep from our end.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.55,1:03:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,"Our end"?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.59,1:03:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yongdu-ri Internet Café.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.93,1:03:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I pretty much run the place.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.47,1:03:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.93,1:03:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.81,1:03:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.89,1:04:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, she's up.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.35,1:04:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hae-in.\N- Are you okay, Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.23,1:04:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some water, Sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.23,1:04:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you go to the hospital?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.19,1:04:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.24,1:04:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.28,1:04:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't sleep well\Nlast night, so I felt dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.48,1:04:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you taking your medication?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.49,1:04:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What medication? Is she sick?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.16,1:04:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for my anemia.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.27,1:04:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You have anemia?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.33,1:04:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your checkup results never showed that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.54,1:04:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How bad is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.54,1:04:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, don't be so dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.67,1:04:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm anemic too.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.63,1:04:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm also dizzy, since\NI couldn't sleep much either.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.38,1:04:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like Soo-cheol is doing fine either.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.30,1:04:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all suffering here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.77,1:05:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even still, it's not normal to faint.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.52,1:05:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tag along with Hyun-woo to Seoul\Ntomorrow and visit a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.36,1:05:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.82,1:05:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What? I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.37,1:05:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so harsh to Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.78,1:05:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- When was I?\N- She's sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.62,1:05:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She fainted.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.58,1:05:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Even a stranger would be concerned.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.21,1:05:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Her mother-in-law...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.13,1:05:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No, her former mother-in-law\Ntakes good care of her anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.72,1:05:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.01,1:05:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in didn't hesitate to obey her.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.47,1:05:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Has she ever done the same to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.51,1:05:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Seon-hwa, do you think you\Nknow everything about Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.22,1:05:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No, of course not, and there's no need for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.52,1:05:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Seon-hwa.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.86,1:05:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.61,1:05:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.03,1:05:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Seon-hwa!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.03,1:05:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.91,1:06:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop calling my name.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.53,1:06:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in is...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.62,1:06:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What about her?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.00,1:06:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do me this favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.04,1:06:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Treat her well, so you won't regret it later on.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.55,1:06:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.17,1:06:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I regret it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.72,1:06:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I never do things I regret.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.35,1:06:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, this is so upsetting.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.73,1:06:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She's going to be so heartbroken.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.02,1:06:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.84,1:07:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't any of my exes like him?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.11,1:07:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I called your doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.69,1:07:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- You can see him tomorrow.\N- Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.70,1:07:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you been up to?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.08,1:07:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.95,1:07:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Some days, he was covered in eggs.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.44,1:07:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Land Purchase Agreement{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.52,1:07:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Secretary Na?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.78,1:07:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Let's have a meeting in the office pantry.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.07,1:07:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Okay.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.99,1:08:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I think he's been meeting...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.62,1:08:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}with those land protestors.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.24,1:08:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}All right.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.50,1:08:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}We'll talk again later.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.58,1:08:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you in touch with her?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.92,1:08:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me how much you found out...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.92,1:08:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,behind my back.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.67,1:08:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your typical real-estate-investment fraud.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.89,1:08:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A broker bought the land\Nin question from the owners,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.51,1:08:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and offered five times the market price.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.72,1:08:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they signed a contract with\NQueens for one-third of that price.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.70,1:08:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,A double contract?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.65,1:08:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's deliberate fraud.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.19,1:08:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to prove that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.40,1:08:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And the broker? You mentioned one.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.23,1:08:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he in Korea? Did he already flee?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.82,1:08:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Paradise Land, Ltd.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.87,1:08:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He did disappear,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.92,1:08:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but he's getting married this weekend.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.05,1:09:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think he plans to fly\Nout immediately afterward,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.18,1:09:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but he won't be able to.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.80,1:09:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I persuaded the landowners to sue,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.51,1:09:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and put him on the No-Fly List today.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.77,1:09:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Things will pan out once we catch him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.02,1:09:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.48,1:09:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but you shouldn't concern yourself...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.77,1:09:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,with this matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.32,1:09:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not? Why shouldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.78,1:09:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.78,1:09:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.57,1:09:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Our family's ruined.\NWe're dirt-poor and homeless.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.33,1:09:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandfather is in a coma.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.95,1:09:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Da-hye ran off.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.00,1:09:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol is out of it,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.41,1:09:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but the worst part...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.17,1:09:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,is that I'm in my ex-husband's hometown.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.80,1:09:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.46,1:09:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,so terrible?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.55,1:09:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to do something...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.30,1:09:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,in this situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.55,1:09:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I even gave myself the\Ninjection that'd raise my WBC.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.19,1:09:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to sit still.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.72,1:09:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. You did well.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.10,1:09:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'll be able to get back on my feet...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.81,1:09:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,if I keep this up,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.98,1:10:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and you'll be able to leave\Nme without feeling worried.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.61,1:10:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll finally part ways...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.07,1:10:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,like a true divorced couple.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.20,1:10:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my goal,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.08,1:10:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,to part ways with you for good.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.50,1:10:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start sharing...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.59,1:10:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,everything with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.26,1:10:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do everything we can,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.72,1:10:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as your body can take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.76,1:10:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You should reach your goal...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.89,1:10:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.89,1:10:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.59,1:11:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}ID Card\NHong Hae-in{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.31,1:12:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Sungmin University Medical Center\NHong Hae-in{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.28,1:12:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Sungmin University Medical Center{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.90,1:12:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll park and come up.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.87,1:12:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.99,1:12:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Are you the patient?\NYes{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.91,1:12:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Reissue Previous Documents{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.41,1:12:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Loading{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.17,1:12:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Referral{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.81,1:12:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Tumor cells have spread between cranial nerves{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.06,1:12:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Treatment unsuccessful due to low WBC{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.07,1:12:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Average estimated life\Nexpectancy to be three months{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.27,1:13:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.78,1:13:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the hospital director\Nrefused to tell me your name,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.24,1:13:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but I finally get to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.78,1:13:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You wrote this diagnosis,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.57,1:13:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,so tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.53,1:13:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I save Hong Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.83,1:13:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I need to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.97,1:14:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here? I'm\Ngoing to the doctor's office.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.21,1:14:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The doctor called.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.56,1:14:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Eun-sung came by.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.41,1:14:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I'm sorry.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.58,1:14:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}You're neither her family nor guardian,\Nso I'm not obligated to tell you.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.54,1:14:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I have nothing to say.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.58,1:14:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Really?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.58,1:14:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Will you tell me if I become her guardian?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.17,1:14:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Yongdu-ri Supermarket{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.18,1:14:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.59,1:14:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.30,1:14:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please sit here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.60,1:14:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.29,1:14:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You see...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.38,1:14:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.40,1:14:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,An old lady lent me her handkerchief.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.23,1:14:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What old lady?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.49,1:14:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So... She...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.11,1:15:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,She had a son.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.24,1:15:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, and his name was...?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.99,1:15:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.00,1:15:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He looked ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.17,1:15:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He looked like Leslie Cheung.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.92,1:15:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In our neighborhood?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.00,1:15:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.09,1:15:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He had a great voice too.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.67,1:15:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Like that of a singer.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.05,1:15:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A man who looks like Leslie Cheung\Nand has the voice of a singer.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.01,1:15:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,In our neighborhood?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.27,1:15:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless it was a ghost,\NI'm afraid you're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.56,1:15:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.44,1:15:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They look similar.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.74,1:15:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.87,1:15:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.37,1:15:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.66,1:15:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes.\N- Okay, let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.17,1:15:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Great timing.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.42,1:15:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinner is ready. Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.05,1:15:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.05,1:15:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I made braised short ribs.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.42,1:15:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Braised short ribs?\N- It's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.97,1:16:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- I hope that's okay.\N- Did you add chestnuts too?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.12,1:16:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you...?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.87,1:16:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Grace visit you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.58,1:16:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you tell her no?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.96,1:16:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.29,1:16:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done. She needs to know her place.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.80,1:16:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Send out a press release and say\NI'll take over the department store.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.97,1:16:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's Hae-in's spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.06,1:16:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.06,1:16:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,She's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.81,1:16:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll manage it until then.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.15,1:16:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't die that easily.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.69,1:16:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take great care of him,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.53,1:17:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,so he lives, but remains unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.28,1:17:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as he's in a coma,\NI'm in charge of 21% of the stocks.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.79,1:17:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.30,1:17:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Take me off the no-fly list\NThis is your only warning{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.00,1:18:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Mr. Yoon Eun-sung{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.88,1:18:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.72,1:18:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.84,1:18:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't share the same goal.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.47,1:18:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the chairman?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.64,1:18:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You shouldn't do this.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.31,1:18:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What if he dies?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.23,1:18:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.85,1:18:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hong Hae-in{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.85,1:18:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}I'm leaving now.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.86,1:19:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going this\Nlate? Let's have dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.58,1:19:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just going...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.20,1:19:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.83,1:20:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Hyun-woo is coming soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.79,1:20:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.25,1:20:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.42,1:20:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We should wait and eat with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.05,1:20:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.76,1:20:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go too far, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.35,1:20:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.48,1:21:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Baek Hyun-woo{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.06,1:21:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.85,1:21:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Baek Hyun-woo{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.65,1:22:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Pyeon Seong-uk?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.40,1:22:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.11,1:22:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. I should be...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.03,1:22:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,in Boracay right now after my wedding,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.45,1:22:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but things have become\Ncomplicated, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.41,1:22:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get my text?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.79,1:22:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I replied and said...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.79,1:22:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,we should deal with it legally,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.08,1:22:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,since I won't drop the suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.11,1:23:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.90,1:23:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that you still kept\Nthis all these years must mean...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.57,1:24:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,you couldn't get her out of your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.07,1:24:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She must've been gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.95,1:24:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.58,1:24:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.83,1:24:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even remember...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.04,1:24:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,if the person was male, female,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.83,1:24:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,a teacher, a student,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.17,1:24:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,or a security guard. I can't remember a thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.76,1:24:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was close.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.43,1:24:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She sure is sharp, just as a CEO should be.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.30,1:24:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How could she get it right away?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.72,1:24:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as she saw it, her gut\Ntold her it belonged to a woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.43,1:24:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It was close.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.94,1:24:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost got caught.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.15,1:24:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.52,1:24:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,you searched the entire school...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.11,1:24:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,for that girl, just like\Nthe prince from "Cinderella"?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.49,1:24:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.53,1:24:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She was really pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.88,1:24:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you still remember that?\N- Vividly.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.84,1:24:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,She was my ideal type.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.34,1:24:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you'd recognize her?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.57,1:25:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.63,1:25:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's too late,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.22,1:25:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but maybe she was your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.60,1:25:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder where she is, and what she's doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.03,1:25:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queen of Tears{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.18,1:25:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}- {\i1}What humiliation did he get?\N- I'm going to kill you!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.81,1:25:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Even still, I would've made the same choice.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.86,1:26:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}You should know by now,\NI do anything I set my mind to.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.36,1:26:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}No amount of money can buy this experience.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.40,1:26:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}- You told me to hold it!\N- Nepotism?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.28,1:26:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Will he move out? Does he want to live with you?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.87,1:26:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}No way. Is he jealous?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.66,1:26:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}From what I heard, he's feigning ignorance.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.45,1:26:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I have a knack for revealing truths.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.33,1:26:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}There's something I must do.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.13,1:26:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}You're really testing my patience,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.00,1:26:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}so just get lost.{\i0}
